\par\par \b \uc2  Danish cbank says stands ready to defend crown. \b0\par\par\uc2 306 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 Dezember 2002\par 12:26\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2002 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  COPENHAGEN, Dec 4 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Denmark\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Nationalbanken, said on Wednesday it would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market and raise rates with determination if the Danish crown were to come under pressure. \par \par \uc2  It also said its monetary policy was shadowing that of the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (ECB) but that it would adjust the difference between the ECB`s and its own leading lending rates according to the development in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves. \par \par \uc2  "When capital movements reverse at some point we are naturally ready to sell \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governer Bodil Nyboe Andersen said in the text of a speech prepared for delivery at the Danish Banks Association`s annual meeting. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  inflow corresponding to almost 50 billion crowns and a strong crown against the euro has allowed the Danish \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to gradually reduce the yield spread to ECB to 20 basis points in recent months. \par \par \uc2  "Those knowing us from earlier will have no doubts that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 `s defence of the crown will be utterly resolute in terms of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and widening of the interest rate spread." \par \par \uc2  Danes rejected euro membership in a referendum in September 2000. The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no inflation or money supply target but adjusts rates for the sole purpose of keeping the crown stable against the euro. \par \par \uc2  "We are taking the crown`s rate against the euro and whether there has been a certain sustained flow of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  into consideration when adjusting the yield spread to ECB," Andersen said. \par \par \uc2  The crown is pegged to the euro  in a plus/minus 2.25 percent fluctuation band around a 7.46038 central parity in the ERM-2 grid. \par \par \uc2  At 1107 GMT, the crown stood around 7.4265 against the euro. \par \par \uc2  At end-November the Danish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves were 195.9 billion crowns. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021204dyc400m82\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
