\par\par \b \uc2  Danish  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  again to help crown. \b0\par\par\uc2 295 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 September 1998\par 15:48\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  COPENHAGEN, Sept 17 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Denmark\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  continued to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday in an effort to relieve pressure on the crown. \par \par \uc2  "We have been in the market again," \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  deputy director Kirsten Mordhorst said. \par \par \uc2  Earlier, she said the bank had \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the morning as well, and confirmed that \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  was now going on for the third straight day. \par \par \uc2  In line with standard \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy, Mordhorst declined comment on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  volumes or levels. \par \par \uc2  At 1335 GMT, the crown was at 3.8127 per mark. \b \highlight22\uc2 Forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the bank had bought crowns for mark at 3.8132 - the Danish unit's weakest level in four months. \par \par \uc2  The crown has softened gradually from 3.8080 on September 1. \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to the amount of 15.7 billion crowns ($2.45 billion) on August 25-26 helped the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strengthen from 3.8110 on August 26. \par \par \uc2  The latest bout of weakness set in on Tuesday after the release of a \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  quarterly report saying Denmark's 1998 current account could fall into deficit after eight years in surplus. \par \par \uc2  On Wednesday, the lowest bid level against the German unit was 3.8127, while the crown sank to 3.8130 on Tuesday when the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped in to support it, \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Dealers said Wednesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been in the region of five billion crowns. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  routinely acts in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to keep the crown steady near its central parity rate against the mark in the EU Exchange Rate Mechanism. \par \par \uc2  ((Peter Starck +45 33 96 96 50, fax +45 33 93 84 57, copenhagen.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021108du9h01alb\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
