\par\par \b \uc2  Danish  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to support crown. \b0\par\par\uc2 250 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 26 August 1998\par 10:24\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  COPENHAGEN, Aug 26 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Denmark\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Wednesday it was \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market selling foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  for the crown to keep the crown steady against the German mark. \par \par \uc2  "Our stated policy is to keep the crown steady by buying and selling foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Right now we are selling foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," deputy director Kirsten Mordhorst told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  At 0815 GMT, the crown stood at 3.8104 per mark. It closed on Tuesday at 3.8103. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  dealers said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had sold around 1.3 billion German marks on Tuesday to support the crown. Mordhorst declined to comment on the volume. \par \par \uc2  Investors have been selling Danish debt in recent days amid a flight to safe-haven German Bunds and U.S. Treasuries triggered by uncertainties linked to Russia and Asia. This trend continued on Wednesday, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  The benchmark 10-year bond yield spread has widened sharply this week, trading around 80 basis points at 0815 GMT compared with 41 bps at last Friday's close. \par \par \uc2  In the two-year maturity, the yield gap over German paper shot out to 128 bps from 67 at Friday's close. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say the widening has nothing to do with Danish domestic factors. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  jitters in neighbouring Sweden and Norway have affected the Danish crown. \par \par \uc2  ((Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 96 96 50, fax +45 33 93 84 57, copenhagen.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021216du8q01mkz\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
