\par\par \b \uc2  EMS Focus: Denmark Krone Steady Despite Election Rumors \b0\par\par\uc2  By Lauren Madsen \par \uc2 268 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 Oktober 1997\par 15:53\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  COPENHAGEN (AP-Dow Jones)--The Danish krone is expected to remain steady as a rock in the days ahead, in part due to an absence of concern among investors about the possibility of a snap general election being called for next month, analysts said. \par \par \uc2  Also, the persistent steadiness of the Danish \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  is a testament to the successful \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Denmark\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which uses monetary policy solely to ensure a steady exchange rate versus the Deutsche mark. \par \par \uc2  Analysts argue that the only event which could really rock the krone is an unexpected rejection of the European Union's Amsterdam Treaty when a referendum is held on it next spring. \par \par \uc2  'There is such huge credibility in the market today towards the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's exchange rate policy,' said Jakob Vejlo, chief economist with Unibank Markets in Copenhagen. 'But if we say `No' to the Amsterdam Treaty, we will probably run into some volatility with the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .' \par \par \uc2  At 1115 GMT Wednesday, the Deutsche mark fetched 3.8072 kroner, compared with 3.8079 at the close of European trading Tuesday. Denmark's ERM central parity rate is 3.81443 kroner to the mark. \par \par \uc2  In April or May, Denmark will hold a referendum on the Amsterdam Treaty, which is designed to prepare the 15-nation bloc for expansion. From a legal point of view, rejection of the treaty, which was agreed in June, could nullify the document and even raise questions about Denmark's future participation in the union. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 01-10-97 \par \par \uc2  1353GMT \par \par \uc2  1089 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dta107dh5\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
